mmit_sha":"f5c9a0a529359e24cf89076ee6df47c33fc34cc0","position":"1785910001708748001-c5955f03-2f8a-4309-b55d-a5a97828a777"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Worktree ../fd30-metrics-toolchain from origin/main. Plan-review BLOCKED on a real finding: pyproject dev extra self-references nava-rebar[agents,metrics], so uv sync --extra dev already pulls lizard transitively. Proven: worktree venv provisioned from UNMODIFIED main imports lizard 1.23.0. Rewrote the plan - the Makefile change is hardening (pins the intent), not a fix; the docs are the substantive deliverable. Re-review PASS, certified at 31f352d5. Claimed.","timestamp":1785904293756898001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Edits done: Makefile install -> 'uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra metrics' (+ rationale comment extending the ce5d uv-locked block, help text updated), install-unlocked -> '.[dev,metrics]'; docs/local-dev-env.md gains a 'Code-health analyzers' section with per-platform scc install (go install/brew/snap/scoop/prebuilt) + npm jscpd, and the degrade-to-Unavailable guarantee; docs/user-guide.md cross-links it. VERIFIED with scc+jscpd removed from PATH (608-symlink sanitized bin): uv lock --check exit 0 (no drift, uv.lock untouched), make install exit 0, make lint exit 0, make typecheck exit 0, rebar metrics exit 0 emitting clean unavailable ('scc executable is unavailable' / 'jscpd executable not found') while lizard complexity still returns real values. A from-scratch uv sync into an empty dir yielded lizard 1.23.0. Targeted metrics+metrics-docs tests: 121 passed, 2 skipped without analyzers. Full suite still running; investigating unrelated failure clusters against a pristine-main control.","timestamp":1785906444315116001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Clean full suite with scc+jscpd removed from PATH: 10234 passed, 38 skipped, exit 0 (32m20s) - the no-analyzer contributor path is PROVEN, not asserted. (An earlier run showed failure clusters but was self-confounded: my fresh-venv proof ran uv sync against the worktree's own .venv while pytest was executing from it; killed and re-run cleanly.) All CI-only gates pass too: comment-hygiene, config-check, server-manifest, verify-gate-parity, raw-git-write, docs-index. Committed 56e0d5bdee and pushed: Gerrit change 1416.","timestamp":1785908533992951001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Patchset 1: LLM-Review +1 (PASS), Verified -1. Cause was NOT my change: the 'Git version floor gate' step failed with 'missing .github/git-version-floor.txt'. That file landed on main in 980d AFTER my branch base, and the Gerrit Verified lane takes the workflow DEFINITION from the target branch while checking out the CHANGE'S tree - the exact definition-vs-tree skew that _build-and-test.yml documents under ticket ee2a and guards against with an if-present check. The new floor gate did not copy that guard. Remedy: rebased onto current origin/main (now includes 980d and dce2); re-verified lock-check/install/lint/typecheck/metrics-degradation all green on the rebased tree; pushed patchset 2 keeping Change-Id Ifcbd4432.","timestamp":1785908801633869001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Patchset 2 (rebased): LLM-Review +1 auto-copied (NO_CODE_CHANGE), Verified +1 on CI run 30979150190 - all gates incl. the Git version floor gate now green. Submitted change 1416 -> MERGED at 06:03:35, replicated to origin/main as 3834269c53. Ticket fd30 closed (7/7 ACs ticked; checkbox-only edit, evidence kept in the ticket comment). Discovered-work: filed the floor-gate skew bug, then closed it as duplicate of the orchestrator's 7e90-233b-3ee9-4f14 (linked duplicates + discovered_from). DONE.","timestamp":1785910001708748001}],"created_at":1785904275375295001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ec6466fd-4e30-430a-b53a-9bc5b3aa525e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"fd30-a088-cbbc-4dbd"}],"description":"","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","fd30-a088-cbbc-4dbd"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"6dfe-30ef-9403-477f","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"fd30: metrics analyzer toolchain in dev bootstrap + document scc/jscpd","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["21805a8a-d75c-4a38-92d3-f304718c52b7","ec6466fd-4e30-430a-b53a-9bc5b3aa525e","cd64f363-06af-484d-8675-0f57ef347a5b","870940bd-514e-4d68-b1ea-0c71d76173f3","24c1dbba-7aef-42a0-86b5-23950a69c559","1da762fd-98cd-4b73-b702-13bbd4f01e48","c5955f03-2f8a-4309-b55d-a5a97828a777"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659617830080001,"uuid":"d22aa241-a68b-4e73-b52b-c6e684a04c0b"}